lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, and September to October came in under 90% of normal in 37 of them. On the middle of the grids, November to December 2025 got 37% of normal and October to November 2025 got 54%. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 35% on the middle of the grids. Grid 18194 had its driest year in 2016 at 54% of normal.</p>"}
